# Local only. `wrangler pages dev` reads .dev.vars. Do not commit that file.
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY and IP_HASH_SALT are runtime secrets.
# The values below are Cloudflare's published Turnstile test pair. They always
# pass, and the API rejects this secret on any host other than localhost.
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=1x0000000000000000000000000000000AA
IP_HASH_SALT=replace-with-a-long-random-string
# Optional site key. Leave unset on localhost; the page uses the test site key.
# If you set it, paste the Site Key, not the name PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY.
# PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
# Optional. Required only for POST /api/review.
# ADMIN_REVIEW_TOKEN=
